### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:9090/actuator/health

### Создать hit #1
POST http://127.0.0.1:9090/hit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "ewm-main-service",
  "uri": "/events/1",
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01 10:00:00"
}

### Создать hit #2
POST http://127.0.0.1:9090/hit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "ewm-main-service",
  "uri": "/events/1",
  "ip": "127.0.0.2",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01 10:05:00"
}

### Статистика (уникальные IP)
GET http://127.0.0.1:9090/stats?start=2025-01-01%2000:00:00&end=2025-01-02%2000:00:00&uris=/events/1&unique=true

### Статистика (все хиты)
GET http://127.0.0.1:9090/stats?start=2025-01-01%2000:00:00&end=2025-01-02%2000:00:00&uris=/events/1
